<section class="ihero"><div class="ihero-text"><div class="ihero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/communities-served/">Communities</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span><span aria-current="page">Sitka</span></nav><p class="kicker">Southeast · City and Borough of Sitka</p><h1>Insurance Appraiser in Sitka, Alaska</h1><p class="lede">On the outer coast of Baranof Island, Sitka faces the open Gulf of Alaska. Wind, rain and steep terrain shape claims in one of Alaska&#x27;s most historic towns.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line light" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div><dl class="facts"><div><dt>Borough</dt><dd>City and Borough of Sitka</dd></div><div><dt>Region</dt><dd>Southeast</dd></div><div><dt>Inspections</dt><dd>On site</dd></div></dl></div></div><figure class="ihero-photo"><img src="/assets/img/photos/sitka.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/sitka-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/sitka.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:900px) 100vw, 55vw" width="1200" height="756" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure></section><div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose"><div class="snap"><div><p class="snap-k">Borough</p><p>City and Borough of Sitka</p></div><div><p class="snap-k">Region</p><p>Southeast</p></div><div class="w"><p class="snap-k">Neighborhoods &amp; areas</p><p>Downtown, Halibut Point Road, Sawmill Creek Road, Japonski Island, Indian River, Kramer Avenue area</p></div><div class="w"><p class="snap-k">Housing mix</p><p>Historic downtown buildings, mid-century frame homes, waterfront homes facing Sitka Sound</p></div><div class="w"><p class="snap-k">Notable events</p><ul><li>August 2015 Kramer Avenue landslide</li><li>Gulf of Alaska windstorms</li><li>Heavy rain events</li></ul></div><div class="w"><p class="snap-k">Local claim risks</p><ul class="chips"><li>Heavy rain</li><li>Gulf windstorms</li><li>Landslides</li><li>Water intrusion</li><li>Snow load</li></ul></div></div>
<h2>Historic town on the outer coast</h2>
<p>Sitka was the capital of Russian America and has a historic downtown with buildings that are more complicated to repair than modern construction. The city faces Sitka Sound and the open Gulf of Alaska, so storms arrive with little to block them.</p>
<h2>Landslides and rain</h2>
<p>In August 2015, heavy rain triggered landslides in Sitka, including one on Kramer Avenue that killed three people. Since then, landslide risk has been a significant local concern. Earth movement is usually excluded from homeowner policies, but water damage and other covered perils may still apply.</p>
<h2>Wind and water intrusion</h2>
<p>Storms from the Gulf bring strong winds and driving rain, which find their way through siding and roofing. Water intrusion claims are common, as are disputes about whether damage is sudden or gradual.</p>
<h2>Housing and common issues</h2>
<ul>
<li>Historic buildings downtown that need specialized repair</li>
<li>Mid-century frame homes along Halibut Point and Sawmill Creek roads</li>
<li>Waterfront homes exposed to wind and salt spray</li>
<li>Barge-dependent material supply that raises costs and lengthens repairs</li>
</ul>
<p>We inspect throughout Sitka, including downtown, Japonski Island, Halibut Point Road and Sawmill Creek Road.</p>
<h2>Services available in Sitka</h2><p>Every Alaska Insurance Appraiser service is available to property owners in Sitka and nearby, including:</p><ul><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/appraisal-panel-representation/">Appraisal Panel Representation</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/home-insurance-claim-appraisal/">Homeowner Claim Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/commercial-hoa-condo-appraisal/">Commercial, HOA &amp; Condo Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/roof-damage-claim-appraisal/">Roof, Hail &amp; Ice Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/windstorm-claim-appraisal/">Windstorm Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/snow-load-ice-dam-claims/">Snow Load &amp; Ice Dam Claims</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/frozen-pipe-water-damage-appraisal/">Frozen Pipe &amp; Water Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-practice/fire-smoke-ash-claim-appraisal/">Fire, Smoke &amp; Wildfire Appraisal</a></li></ul>
<h2>Questions from Sitka property owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is landslide damage covered?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Usually not under a standard homeowner policy, which excludes earth movement. Specialty coverage may be available.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do historic buildings cost more to repair?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Often yes. If your policy covers replacement with like kind and quality, historic materials and methods may be part of the scope.</p></div></details></div><h2>Nearby communities</h2><div class="rel-grid"><a class="rel" href="/communities-served/juneau-insurance-appraiser/"><small>Community</small><span>Juneau</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/communities-served/ketchikan-insurance-appraiser/"><small>Community</small><span>Ketchikan</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/communities-served/kodiak-insurance-appraiser/"><small>Community</small><span>Kodiak</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="side"><div class="side-stick"><div class="side-box call"><h2 class="side-h">Talk it through</h2><p>Free first conversation. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="side-phone" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn gold block" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fr